由 Codex 接续补做 agent-adaptor PR #30 的本机影子接入（审查标识：便便）。

Route the existing daemon claim/UI path through the public SDK, bind comments to actual delivery receipts, retain business Thread identity and healthy checkpoints, and wait for cleanup before continuation. Keep native default behavior and disclose bounded config-drift fallback, in-memory continuity and timeout limits. Actual application acceptance is tracked separately.
